# Don't include large reference materials in the Docker context — they'd
# poison the cde tag computation (any change → new tag → image-not-found
# until rebuild) without being used by the trainer container.
*.pdf
*.png
*.pptx
docs/
research/
notebooks/
k8s/
manifests/
.git/
.pytest_cache/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# autoperf agent state — read by the cde wrapper / harness, not the
# trainer container. Including these poisons the build hash whenever
# the agent edits iter_log/lever_queue/BLOCKED/etc. iter-17 failed
# 2× ImagePullBackOff for this exact reason (2026-05-12).
autoperf/
cde.yaml
